			"Message": "docs(Wind): Add license/changelog emoji headers and enrich funding section\n\nAdd emoji indicators (⚖️, 📜) to the License and Changelog section headings for visual consistency with other sections. Expand the Funding & Acknowledgements narrative with a preamble about Land's open-source mission and a more detailed description of the NLnet NGI0 Commons Fund grant (including a link to the project page).\n\nRestructure the funding table with an explicit `<thead>` row labeling the four partner entities (Land, PlayForm, NLnet, NGI0 Commons Fund) for improved accessibility and readability. Fix the Land logo link URL to lowercase `editor.land` for consistency. Broaden the Changelog description to refer to \"a history of changes\" instead of changes specific to Wind, matching the more general tone.",
